# Build artifacts — the release binary is ~5 MB and rebuilt from source.
/target/

# Runtime configuration. Holds DATABASE_URL, which carries the Postgres
# password. Never commit it, and never log it either: see redact_db_url() in
# src/main.rs, which exists because the startup line printed this credential
# into journald on every start once the store moved from SQLite to Postgres.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
